Today is a big day.
I am in this small room.
I am packing my suitcase.
The suitcase is kept on the floor.
My clothes are in the suitcase.
Some of my books are lying on the bed.
I put the books in the suitcase too.
Then I look inside the small cupboard.
The cupboard is empty.
There is nothing inside the cupboard.
My laptop is kept on the table.
The table is near the window.
I pick up my laptop.
Now I look under the bed.
My shoes are kept there.
I take the shoes out.
Now there is nothing of mine in the room.
All my things are in the suitcase.
I close my suitcase.
I am ready for the new home.
